## Env Vars

| Variable | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `QB_CLIENT_ID` | Intuit OAuth app client ID (shared) |
| `QB_CLIENT_SECRET` | Intuit OAuth app client secret (shared) |
| `QB_REDIRECT_URI` | Admin callback URL |
| `QB_CORP_REDIRECT_URI` | Corp callback URL |
| `QB_COACH_REDIRECT_URI` | Coach callback URL |
| `QB_ENVIRONMENT` | `sandbox` or `production` |

All callback URIs must be registered in the Intuit Developer Portal under the same app's "Redirect URIs" list.
